# Sports Talk — environment template (safe to commit)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev
# 1. cp .env.example .env.local
# 2. Add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (rotate any key that was ever pasted in chat).
# 3. Restart `pnpm dev`.
#
# Production (Vercel / Netlify / similar)
# • In the host dashboard, add a server secret: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (same as local).
# • Do NOT add the key to VITE_* vars — those are exposed in the browser bundle.
# • The repo uses `api/anthropic/v1/messages.ts` on Vercel (no VITE_* secret).
# • Use variable name exactly: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY — enable for Production (and Preview if needed), then Redeploy.
# • The built app calls `/api/anthropic/v1/messages` on the same origin; no
#   VITE_ANTHROPIC_PROXY_BASE is required unless the proxy is on another URL.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: model id (build-time; visible in client bundle)
# VITE_ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929

# Optional: only if Anthropic proxy is NOT same-origin (default is /api/anthropic)
# VITE_ANTHROPIC_PROXY_BASE=https://your-api-host.example.com/api/anthropic
